      "sourceTextSha256": "5170e54b8301dccec71327493e6756d6b8d0de36d27a637cb9eec65d4f89ff0c",
      "text": "Day 1 · Arrival at Rio de Janeiro Airport, meeting with your driver and transfer to the hotel. Free time. Rio is all about green hills, blue skies, rocky peaks, coves, islands and beautiful beaches: Brazil’s second-largest city, after São Paulo, and one of the most beautiful in the world. Copacabana, Ipanema and Leblon line the ocean with their famous black-and-white mosaic promenades, where football and volleyball are played on the sand from morning until late at night, and beach kiosks serve cold coconut water and freshly squeezed juices.",
